{"step_index":2885,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T13:31:38Z","input_tokens":2459,"cache_read_tokens":151636,"output_tokens":3574,"thinking":"Analyzing the necessary CSS styles, focusing on components like breadcrumb navigation, the beginner mode toggle, workspace navigation controls, error message displays, and test error indicators. This requires examining how each element is visually structured and styled to ensure appropriate presentation and functionality. Determining the styles ensures that all interface elements align and render correctly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import re\n\nstyles_path = r'C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css'\nwith open(styles_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    css = f.read()\n\nphase9_css = '''\n/* ==========================================================================\n   PHASE 9: USER INTERFACE, EXPERIENCE, ACCESSIBILITY & BREADCRUMBS\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Breadcrumb Navigation */\n.dsa-breadcrumb-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light, #e2e8f0);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 8px);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\n}\n\n.breadcrumb-item {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--primary-blue, #2563eb);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  transition: all 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.breadcrumb-item:hover {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n.breadcrumb-item.current {\n  color: var(--text-main, #0f172a);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: default;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.breadcrumb-sep {\n  color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n/* Beginner Mode Toggle Button */\n.btn-mode-toggle {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 5px 12px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  border: 1px solid #10b981;\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  color: #065f46;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-mode-toggle:hover {\n  background: #d1fae5;\n  border-color: #059669;\n}\n\n.btn-mode-toggle:not(.active) {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  border-color: #cbd5e1;\n  color: #475569;\n}\n\n.btn-mode-toggle:not(.active):hover {\n  background: #e2e8f0;\n  color: #0f172a;\n}\n\n/* Workspace Prev / Next Navigation Controls */\n.workspace-prev-next-nav {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light, #e2e8f0);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 2px 4px;\n  margin-left: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-ws-nav-step {\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--primary-blue, #2563eb);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  transition: all 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-ws-nav-step:hover {\n  background: #dbeafe;\n  color: var(--primary-blue-hover, #1d4ed8);\n}\n\n.ws-step-indicator {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n}\n\n/* Educational Error Card & Beginner Feedback */\n.console-error-card {\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 8px);\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.error-badge-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.error-badge {\n  background: #dc2626;\n  color: white;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n}\n\n.error-line-badge {\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.error-message-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n.error-beginner-tip {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #fed7aa;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #9a3412;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.test-error-hint {\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #92400e;\n  background: #fffbeb;\n  border: 1px solid #fef3c7;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 4px 8px;\n}\n\n/* Enhanced Empty State Card */\n.dsa-empty-state-card {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 40px 24px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px dashed var(--border-medium, #cbd5e1);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 12px);\n  margin: 16px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.dsa-empty-state-card .empty-state-icon {\n  font-size: 36px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.dsa-empty-state-card .empty-state-heading {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main, #0f172a);\n}\n\n.dsa-empty-state-card .empty-state-text {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary, #475569);\n  max-width: 520px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-clear-empty-filters {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 7px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 8px);\n  border: none;\n  background: var(--primary-blue, #2563eb);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-clear-empty-filters:hover {\n  background: var(--primary-blue-hover, #1d4ed8);\n}\n\n/* Compact Spacing & Gap Adjustments (Interface Beauty) */\n.dsa-learning-container {\n  padding: 14px 20px 48px;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.dsa-wrapper {\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.dsa-metrics-grid {\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.metric-card {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n}\n\n.workspace-hero-banner {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.workspace-top-bar {\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.workspace-2col-layout {\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.guide-card {\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n/* Responsive Rules for Small Devices & Narrow Screens */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .dsa-metrics-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n\n  .dsa-two-col-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .workspace-2col-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .top-bar-primary {\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .brand-area {\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .dsa-metrics-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .dsa-subnav {\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .table-meta-bar {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .workspace-top-bar {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .workspace-quick-actions {\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n}\n\n/* High Contrast Status Indicator Consistency */\n.status-pill-solved,\n.solved-pill {\n  background: #ecfdf5 !important;\n  border: 1px solid #10b981 !important;\n  color: #065f46 !important;\n  font-weight: 600 !important;\n}\n\n.status-pill-attempted {\n  background: #fffbeb !important;\n  border: 1px solid #f59e0b !important;\n  color: #92400e !important;\n  font-weight: 600 !important;\n}\n\n.status-pill-review {\n  background: #f5f3ff !important;\n  border: 1px solid #8b5cf6 !important;\n  color: #6d28d9 !important;\n  font-weight: 600 !important;\n}\n'''\n\nif '/* PHASE 9: USER INTERFACE, EXPERIENCE, ACCESSIBILITY & BREADCRUMBS */' not in css:\n    css += '\\n' + phase9_css\n    with open(styles_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(css)\n    print(\"[SUCCESS] Phase 9 CSS appended to styles.css\")\nelse:\n    print(\"[INFO] Phase 9 CSS already present in styles.css\")\n","Description":"Append Phase 9 CSS to styles.css","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/scratch/append_phase9_css.py","toolAction":"Creating append_phase9_css.py","toolSummary":"Create append_phase9_css.py"}}]}
